        "text_kHbKV8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Seventh Circle: Creatives in Business is a fully sponsored, 7-week live webinar programme designed to equip emerging entrepreneurs with the real-world tools, knowledge, and systems needed to build a purposeful, long-lasting brand.<br/><br/>Led by the CEO and Founder of Seventh, who brings over 13 years of experience as a creative entrepreneur, this course offers an honest and in-depth look at what it truly takes to build a business from the ground up. You’ll also hear from guest experts, including our Creative Director and CFO, who bring their insights into key areas such as branding, production, and financial management.<br/><br/>Over the seven weeks, we pour out what has worked for us- practically and creatively. Each session includes live teaching, weekly Q&As, actionable takeaways, and the opportunity to connect with a cohort of like-minded creatives who are all on the journey of building something meaningful.<br/><br/>We only run this programme twice a year, and spaces are fully sponsored for all selected participants.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
