    "rich_text_khne6w": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_3wUAzA": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Course Curriculum",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_DtxqBF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong><br/><br/>Session 1 – Introductions & Intentions<br/><br/></strong>We kick off by reflecting on your purpose—why you’re stepping into business—and setting clear intentions. You’ll also meet the full cohort, creating space for connection and collaboration from day one.<br/><br/><strong>Session 2 – Product Concept<br/><br/></strong>We dive into your product: What problem does it solve? What space does it occupy? And how does it define what you’re known for as a brand?<br/><br/><strong>Session 3 – Creating the Brand<br/><br/></strong>Led by our Creative Director, this session explores how to build a brand that not only stands out visually but also creates emotional resonance with your audience.<br/><br/><strong>Session 4 – Marketing Position & Audience<br/><br/></strong>Here, we identify your true place in the market—who you’re speaking to, who you’re actually serving, and whether your offering aligns with your audience’s needs. We also help you define your customer profiles with precision.<br/><br/><strong>Session 5 – Production<br/><br/></strong>This session covers the realities of managing production—from common pitfalls to practical solutions. We share strategies for building a smoother process and provide a curated directory of trusted production contacts.<br/><br/><strong>Session 6 – Numbers<br/><br/></strong>Led by our CFO, this session simplifies the financial side of business—covering cash flow, margin, expense tracking, and the key financial habits every brand needs to sustain and grow.<br/><br/><strong>Session 7 – Marketing<br/><br/></strong>We close with how to get your brand seen. From social media and email to content and campaign strategy, we explore marketing tactics that build awareness, engagement, and long-term brand growth.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
