        "text_DwEqQG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><br/><br/>“I really really enjoyed the sessions. I have had my baby now and the sessions were the perfect lead up to help me feel confident in my business and next steps entering post maternity, whereby before I panicked to think of how to take my brand to the next level and make it something that’s built on strong foundations to actually be a viable business and model to live off. I really appreciate all the time Bukki, Emmanuel and Thomas took out of their week to help us as a group and it’s given me a lot to think about and work on, I’ve left feeling really motivated which was something I felt I was stagnant in feeling. Thank you again”<br/><br/><br/>“I would like to express my gratitude to Bukki and the team for their exceptional generosity and unusual giving. I really enjoyed being a part of the program, and despite being a non-native English speaker and coming from an area with a lot of prejudice, with the added challenge of ongoing escalation, I had a fantastic time and found the lessons and homework to be very beneficial. (even though I didn't present them, I did complete them). Thank you very much for everything, and I hope we have the opportunity to meet in person someday!”<br/><br/><br/>“The sessions gave me a renewed sense of faith within myself, between the learning, the networking, and seeing people where I want to be, and on a similar journey to me, I felt more confident than ever to work towards my vision of success.”<br/><br/>“It was very interactive and the different designers shared their own personal experiences, based on the topic Bukki was teaching us”.<br/><br/>“Bukki was fully transparent with everything she learned about the business, and also answered any of our concerns. She was very specific, and also, very validating. She made it feel that we can all be successful in this area.”<br/><br/><br/>“For me, hearing Bukki, being in the company of other creatives, and diving together into the intricacies of the business was exciting every week. The points that I found most valuable were the concrete examples, the numbers, the obstacles, and the ways to overcome them, both from Bukki and from the group”.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
